ARCHITECTURE DIRECTORY (tam-ring)

This folder is for architecture notes. It documents the architectural
patterns, data structures, and algorithms of the reference implementations
tracked in ideas/, as well as how tam-ring plans to implement or adapt
them under the Tamlinux philosophy (pure C11, minimal dependencies,
libtam-only linkage, and first-class Linux virtual console support).

Contents:

- oama.md    : Architectural mechanisms and OAuth2 flows in oama
               (ideas/oama.md) and tam-ring's planned C11 adaptations.
- pizauth.md : Daemon vs. daemonless concurrency, locking, and token
               lifecycle in pizauth (ideas/pizauth.md) and tam-ring.
